# prompts/system/.gitkeep
# ------------------------
# System-level prompt templates will be stored here.
# These are top-level instructions that define the LLM's persona,
# capabilities, and behavioural guardrails for the entire platform.
# Example files (future phases):
#   - base_system.txt          (default system prompt for all interactions)
#   - strict_grounding.txt     (prompt variant that enforces citation-only answers)
